# Google Cloud Console API Keys for DukeVibington Civic Dashboard
# Enable in Google Cloud: Maps JavaScript API, Places API, Geocoding API, and Google Civic Information API

# Put this in sites/dukevibington/.env:
VITE_GOOGLE_MAPS_API_KEY=AIzaSyYourGoogleMapsApiKeyHere
VITE_GOOGLE_CIVIC_API_KEY=AIzaSyYourGoogleCivicApiKeyHere
